      "content": "the pediatrician office is totally closed right now and i cant get through to anyone and he is crying so much. i just need to know if it's actually dangerous or if people do this all the time. if i give him the 10ml just once so he can sleep, is that really going to hurt him? i feel like i'm overreacting because it's just a fever.",
